# Audit Workflows — La PesquerApp

Use these workflows when the user requests audits or review passes:

- Code audit: `docs/agent-system/workflows/code-audit.md`
- UI audit: `docs/agent-system/workflows/ui-audit.md`
- Mobile UI: `docs/agent-system/workflows/mobile-ui.md`

## Rules

- Audits are read-only unless Jose explicitly asks to implement fixes.
- Present inventory before broad audits.
- Report findings with severity and file references.
- Offer GAP creation for approved findings.
- Read `docs/agent-system/memory/project-learnings.md` before broad audits.
